00:00:07.289 --> 00:00:13.080
Hi, yes, my name is Jamie and I'm calling
from Georgia.

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:14.080
Great to hear.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.100
Well, thank you so much.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:18.279
I'll watch your show all the time.

00:00:18.279 --> 00:00:25.919
Uh, my question is at this point, you know,
we have elected officials going on TV saying

00:00:25.919 --> 00:00:31.789
they absolutely will not uphold their oath
of office because they're going to cover up

00:00:31.789 --> 00:00:42.370
or at what point do we as citizens have enough
legal basis to follow civil suit against these

00:00:42.370 --> 00:00:46.379
people that are basically causing all of us
harm?

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:48.269
You know, would there be heist,

00:00:48.269 --> 00:00:54.420
I mean, listen, we probably already have a
basis to do it in the sense that the interest

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:58.500
of the American people have not really been
represented by our elected officials for a

00:00:58.500 --> 00:00:59.949
very long time.

00:00:59.949 --> 00:01:04.750
The thing is though, as soon as you do it,
what, what court is going to allow that to

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:05.750
move forward, right?

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:11.509
And even if you get some lower court to allow
it to move forward, uh, where it's just an

00:01:11.509 --> 00:01:18.220
unfortunately because what you are, what you're
trying to fight, Tammy is the system that

00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:26.000
has put in place those who control every aspect
of the judiciary, the executive branch, the

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:27.000
legislative.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:30.979
So we probably already have a basis to Sue
on that, uh, on those grounds.

00:01:30.979 --> 00:01:33.719
But it's just not going to go anywhere.

00:01:33.719 --> 00:01:34.719
Unfortunately.

00:01:34.719 --> 00:01:35.719
I see.

00:01:35.719 --> 00:01:41.040
You know, it, it just does feel like, you
know, at this point, you know, we can impeach

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:44.830
and we can do all this up there or we can
try as we are now.

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:50.740
But uh, it does start to, at what point does
it fit too much in our favor, you know, and

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:57.430
