to the fact that there are other ramifications

00:01:57.430 --> 00:01:58.430
for their behavior.

00:01:58.430 --> 00:01:59.430
I wish you were right.

00:01:59.430 --> 00:02:00.960
I think, I think it would go nowhere.

00:02:00.960 --> 00:02:04.020
But while I have you on the phone, since you're
calling from Georgia, what's going on with

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:05.200
